[node name="TestRing" type="Node3D"]
editor_description = "PANOPTICON greybox arena. 0.5 m grid throughout. Deck r35-r60 (25 m track), outer wall +8 m, tower room floor at y=15. Runners go counter-clockwise from PrisonerStart (+5 deg) all the way round to PrisonerEnd (-5 deg), 8 m apart across LapDivider."

